1
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:54,000
When life keeps you apart, fight for every inch.

2
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:42,000
Five Feet Apart is a romance, drama film directed by Justin Baldoni.

3
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Seventeen-year-old Stella spends most of her time in the
hospital as a cystic fibrosis patient.

4
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:18,000
Her life is full of routines, boundaries and self-control — all of which get put to the test
when she meets Will, an impossibly charming teen who has the same illness.

5
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:06,000
There's an instant flirtation, though restrictions dictate that
they must maintain a safe distance between them.

6
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:54,000
As their connection intensifies, so does the temptation to throw the
rules out the window and embrace that attraction.

7
00:40:36,000 --> 00:40:42,000
Stella Grant, played by Haley Lu Richardson.

8
00:46:24,000 --> 00:46:30,000
Will Newman, played by Cole Sprouse.

9
00:52:12,000 --> 00:52:18,000
Poe Ramírez, played by Moisés Arias.

10
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:06,000
Barbara, played by Kimberly Hébert Gregory.

11
01:03:48,000 --> 01:03:54,000
Dr. Noor Hamid, played by Parminder Nagra.

12
01:09:36,000 --> 01:09:42,000
Meredith Newman, played by Claire Forlani.

13
01:15:24,000 --> 01:15:30,000
Five Feet Apart is a 2019 American coming-of-age romantic drama film directed by Justin Baldoni
(in his directorial debut) and written by Mikki Daughtry and Tobias Iaconis.

14
01:21:12,000 --> 01:21:18,000
The film was inspired by Claire Wineland, who had cystic fibrosis.

15
01:27:00,000 --> 01:27:06,000
Haley Lu Richardson and Cole Sprouse play two young patients with cystic fibrosis who try to
have a relationship despite being forced to stay five feet apart from each other.

16
01:32:48,000 --> 01:32:54,000
The film was released in the United States on March
15, 2019, by CBS Films via Lionsgate.

17
01:38:36,000 --> 01:38:42,000
It received mixed reviews from critics and grossed $92 million worldwide.

18
01:44:24,000 --> 01:44:30,000
The film explores themes of forbidden love, terminal
illness, hospital, best friend, falling in love.

19
01:50:12,000 --> 01:50:18,000
The tone is emotional.
